@startuml 使用案例1_4_領養申請提交
title 使用案例1.4: 領養申請提交

actor "一般會員" as User
participant "AnimalDetail.vue" as DetailPage
participant "applications.ts" as ApplicationAPI
participant "applications.py(blueprint)" as ApplicationBlueprint
participant "application_service.py" as ApplicationService
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
participant "application.py(model)" as ApplicationModel
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "shelter.py(model)" as ShelterModel
participant "others.py(Notification)(model)" as NotificationModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 前置準備 - 檢視動物詳情 ==
User -> DetailPage: 在動物詳情頁面
activate DetailPage
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 檢查使用者狀態
alt 使用者已登入且為一般會員
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示「我想領養」按鈕
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示申請按鈕
else 使用者未登入
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示「登入以領養」按鈕
    DetailPage --> User: 提示需登入
else 動物已被領養(ADOPTED)
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 隱藏申請按鈕
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示「已被領養」標籤
end
note right
  注意: 前端不檢查「已有待審核申請」
  此檢查由後端 Stage 6 執行
end note
deactivate DetailPage

== 2. 開啟申請表單 ==
User -> DetailPage: 點擊「我想領養」按鈕
activate DetailPage
DetailPage -> DetailPage: handleApply()
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 前端驗證:\n- 檢查是否為一般會員\n- 檢查是否為自己的動物
alt 驗證失敗
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
    deactivate DetailPage
else 驗證通過
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 重置表單資料
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示申請表單對話框
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示申請表單
    deactivate DetailPage
end

== 3. 填寫申請資訊 ==
User -> DetailPage: 填寫申請資訊
activate DetailPage
note right
  必填欄位:
  - 申請類型(領養/中途送養)
  - 聯絡電話
  - 聯絡地址
  - 職業
  - 居住環境
  - 是否有經驗
  - 申請原因
  
  選填欄位:
  - 備註
  
  注意: 前端無即時驗證
  僅在提交時檢查 agreeTerms
end note

opt 使用者取消申請
    User -> DetailPage: 點擊「取消」或關閉對話框
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: closeApplicationModal()
    DetailPage --> User: 關閉對話框,回到動物詳情頁
    note right
      替代流程:
      系統不儲存資料
      直接返回詳情頁
    end note
    deactivate DetailPage
end

== 4. 提交申請 ==
User -> DetailPage: 勾選同意條款
User -> DetailPage: 點擊「提交申請」
DetailPage -> DetailPage: submitApplication()
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 生成 Idempotency-Key\nkey = "apply-{animal_id}-{timestamp}"

note right
  冪等性機制:
  使用 Idempotency-Key
  防止重複提交
end note

DetailPage -> ApplicationAPI: createApplication(data, idempotencyKey)
activate ApplicationAPI
ApplicationAPI -> ApplicationBlueprint: POST /applications\nHeader: Idempotency-Key
activate ApplicationBlueprint

== 5. 後端驗證與檢查 ==
ApplicationBlueprint -> ApplicationService: create_application(applicant, data, idempotency_key)
activate ApplicationService

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 權限檢查\n只有一般會員可申請
ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 驗證必填欄位 (animal_id)

ApplicationService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter_by(\nanimal_id=:id, deleted_at=None).first()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = :id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: 動物資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ApplicationService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 檢查動物狀態\n(status == PUBLISHED)
alt 動物已被領養
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ValidationError:\n「此動物已被領養」
    ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 400 Bad Request
    ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 錯誤訊息
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤
else 動物狀態非PUBLISHED
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ValidationError:\n「此動物目前無法申請領養」
    ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 400 Bad Request
    ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 錯誤訊息
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤
else 申請人是刊登者本人
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ValidationError:\n「不能申請自己刊登的動物」
    ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 400 Bad Request
    ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 錯誤訊息
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤
end

== 6. 冪等性與重複檢查 ==
note right of ApplicationService
  冪等性檢查優先執行
  避免重複檢查的 409 錯誤
  
  ⚠️ 實際代碼問題:
  冪等性檢查在代碼中出現兩次
  (line 191 和 line 227)
  第二次檢查是多餘的
end note

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(\nidempotency_key=:key,\napplicant_id=:applicant_id).first()
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE idempotency_key = :key\nAND applicant_id = :applicant_id
activate DB
alt 找到相同冪等性鍵值
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 既有申請記錄
    deactivate DB
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
    deactivate ApplicationModel
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: 返回既有申請
    note right
      冪等性保護:
      相同請求返回相同結果
      避免重複創建
    end note
    ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 201 Created (既有記錄)
    ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 申請成功
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示成功訊息
else 無相同冪等性鍵值
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 無記錄
    deactivate DB
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: None
    deactivate ApplicationModel
end

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(\nanimal_id=:id, applicant_id=:id,\ndeleted_at=None).filter(\nstatus.in_([PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW, APPROVED]))
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id = :animal_id\nAND applicant_id = :applicant_id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nAND status IN ('PENDING', 'UNDER_REVIEW', 'APPROVED')
activate DB
alt 已有進行中的申請
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 既有申請
    deactivate DB
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
    deactivate ApplicationModel
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ConflictError:\n「您已對此動物提交申請」
    ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 409 Conflict
    ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 衝突錯誤
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤並導向我的申請
else 無進行中的申請
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 無衝突
    deactivate DB
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: None
    deactivate ApplicationModel
end

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(\nanimal_id=:id, deleted_at=None).filter(\nstatus.in_([PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW]))
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id = :animal_id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nAND status IN ('PENDING', 'UNDER_REVIEW')
activate DB
alt 該動物有其他人的待審核申請
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 有待審核申請
    deactivate DB
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
    deactivate ApplicationModel
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ConflictError:\n「此動物目前有待審核的申請,請等待審核結果後再提出申請」
    ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 409 Conflict
    ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 衝突錯誤
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 該動物無待審核申請
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 無待審核申請
    deactivate DB
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: None
    deactivate ApplicationModel
end

== 7. 創建申請記錄 ==
ApplicationService -> DB: SELECT MAX(application_id)\nFROM applications
activate DB
note right
  SQLite 相容性處理:
  手動分配 application_id
  
  原因: SQLite 不支援 BIGINT autoincrement
  需手動計算 next_id = (max_id or 0) + 1
end note
DB --> ApplicationService: max_id
deactivate DB

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 組裝 Application 物件\nnext_id = max_id + 1\nstatus = PENDING\nsubmitted_at = NOW()\nidempotency_key = :key

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: 創建 Application 實例
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: INSERT INTO applications\n(application_id, animal_id, applicant_id,\ntype, status, contact_phone, contact_address,\noccupation, housing_type, has_experience,\nreason, notes, idempotency_key, ...)\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationModel: 插入成功
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService -> DB: COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationService: 提交成功
deactivate DB

== 8. 發送通知 ==
ApplicationService -> NotificationService: notify_application_submitted(\napplication, applicant_name, animal_name)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.get(animal_id)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = :id
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: 動物資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> NotificationService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 確定接收者 ID\nrecipient_id = animal.owner_id

opt owner_id 不存在且 shelter_id 存在
    NotificationService -> ShelterModel: Shelter.query.get(shelter_id)
    activate ShelterModel
    ShelterModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM shelters\nWHERE shelter_id = :id
    activate DB
    DB --> ShelterModel: 收容所資料
    deactivate DB
    ShelterModel --> NotificationService: Shelter 物件
    deactivate ShelterModel
    NotificationService -> NotificationService: recipient_id = shelter.primary_account_user_id
end
note right
  順序判斷邏輯:
  1. 優先使用 animal.owner_id
  2. 若 owner_id 為 None
     才查詢 shelter.primary_account_user_id
end note

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 組裝通知 payload\n{application_id, animal_id, applicant_name, ...}

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: NotificationService.create(\nrecipient_id, type, actor_id, payload)
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(user_id, type, actor_id, payload,\ntitle, message, ...)\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
note right
  通知內容:
  「{applicant_name} 對您的動物
  {animal_name} 提出了領養申請」
  
  通知類型:
  application_submitted
end note
DB --> NotificationModel: 通知已創建
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: Notification 物件
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService --> ApplicationService: 通知發送成功
deactivate NotificationService

note right
  通知失敗不影響主流程
  僅記錄錯誤日誌
end note

== 9. 返回結果 ==
ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: 返回申請物件
deactivate ApplicationService
ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 201 Created\n{message, application}
deactivate ApplicationBlueprint
ApplicationAPI --> DetailPage: 申請成功
deactivate ApplicationAPI

== 10. 顯示成功與導向 ==
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 關閉申請對話框

alt 提交成功
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示成功提示\n「申請已提交!送養人將會審核您的申請」
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: router.push('/my/applications')
    DetailPage --> User: 立即導向「我的申請」頁面
else 錯誤 409/500 (重複申請)
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示錯誤訊息\n「您已經對此動物提交過申請了"
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: setTimeout(() => \n  router.push('/my/applications')\n, 3000)
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示錯誤後 3 秒自動跳轉
    note right
      前端特殊處理:
      檢測錯誤訊息包含
      "已對此動物提交申請"
      或 "已提交" 或 "重複"
    end note
end
deactivate DetailPage

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 申請記錄已存入資料庫(status=PENDING)
  2. 送養者收到通知
  3. 申請人被導向「我的申請」頁面
  4. 動物狀態暫不改變(仍為PUBLISHED)
  
  **業務規則:**
  - 僅一般會員可提出申請
  - 不能申請自己的動物
  - 每個動物同時只能有一個待審核申請
  - 每位使用者對同一動物只能有一個進行中的申請
  - 使用冪等性鍵值防止重複提交
  
  **錯誤處理:**
  - 400: 驗證失敗(狀態不符、權限不足等)
  - 409: 衝突(重複申請、已有待審核申請)
  - 500: 系統錯誤
  
  **通知機制:**
  - 申請提交後立即通知送養者
  - 通知失敗不影響申請創建
end note

@enduml